    {
      "Id": 130142018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我老家是在中国深山里的贵州，是个农户。/n父亲也教拳法，可如今这年头，靠那个挣不了多少钱。",
      "BgmFileName": "5",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "1301420140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130142019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "所以，为了养活贫穷的家庭，父母不得不外出工作。/n我的厨艺会进步，大概就是因为替父母掌勺吧。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "1301420150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130142020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "也是在那段贫穷的日子里，我遇见了戏剧。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "1301420160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130142021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "只要演戏，只要成为Dai Star，就算小孩子也能赚钱。/n哪怕是没学问、没家世的我，也能帮助家人。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "1301420170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130142022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "既然如此，我要走的路就是——戏剧。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "1301420180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130142023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我上不起戏剧学校，也进不起剧团。/n只能照葫芦画瓢，和兄弟姐妹们一遍遍练习。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "1301420190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130142024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "现在回想起来，那完全是自成一派的拙劣东西。/n可老天没有漏掉我。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "1301420200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130142025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "后来，我就这样进了剧团，也几次登上舞台。/n我的实力得到了认可，但还不够。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "1301420210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130142026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我想让家里过得更轻松，想摆脱贫穷。/n所以我必须进入能赚更多钱的剧团。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "1301420220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130142027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "——然后，我找到了。/n一直寻找的摇钱树。不，是那颗金色之星。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "1301420230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
